menu "Blink settings"

    config BLINK_GPIO
        int "LED GPIO number"
        range 0 21
        default 8
        help
            GPIO connected to the LED. GPIO8 is a common choice on ESP32-C3
            boards, but the exact pin depends on the board.

    config BLINK_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "LED is active-low"
        default n
        help
            Enable when the LED turns on with a logic-low output.

    config BLINK_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Toggle interval (milliseconds)"
        range 50 60000
        default 500
        help
            Time between LED state changes.

endmenu
